expression: "query(Company::query().where_(Company::NAME.contains_ignore_case(\"Équipe 50%_\")).or_where(Company::COUNTRY.eq_ignore_case(\"Österreich\")))"
---
PostgreSQL: SELECT "companies"."id", "companies"."name", "companies"."country" FROM "companies" WHERE ("companies"."name" ~ $1) OR ("companies"."country" ~ $2)
  values: [String(Some("[Éé][qQ][uU][iI][pP][eE] 50\\%\\_")), String(Some("^[Öö][sS][tT][eE][rR][rR][eE][iI][cC][hH]$"))]
MySQL: SELECT `companies`.`id`, `companies`.`name`, `companies`.`country` FROM `companies` WHERE INSTR(CAST(LOWER(`companies`.`name`) AS BINARY), CAST(? AS BINARY)) > ? OR CAST(LOWER(`companies`.`country`) AS BINARY) = CAST(? AS BINARY)
  values: [String(Some("équipe 50%_")), Int(Some(0)), String(Some("österreich"))]
SQLite: SELECT "companies"."id", "companies"."name", "companies"."country" FROM "companies" WHERE ("companies"."name" GLOB ?) OR ("companies"."country" GLOB ?)
